#: ../main_window.rst:317
msgid ""
"The OpenShot main window is composed of multiple **docks**. These **docks** "
"are arranged and snapped together into a grouping that we call a **View**. "
"OpenShot includes :guilabel:`Simple View`, :guilabel:`Color View`, and "
":guilabel:`My Views` (user-defined layouts)."
msgstr ""
"Jendela utama OpenShot terdiri dari beberapa **dock**. **Dock** ini diatur "
"dan ditempelkan bersama dalam sebuah kelompok yang kami sebut **View**. "
"OpenShot mencakup :guilabel:`Simple View`, :guilabel:`Color View`, dan "
":guilabel:`My Views` (tata letak yang ditentukan pengguna)."

# Main-window terminology review, 2026-09-26.
#: ../main_window.rst:323
msgid ""
"This is the **default** view, and is designed to be easy-to-use, especially "
"for first-time users. It contains :guilabel:`Project Files` on the top left,"
" :guilabel:`Preview Window` on the top right, and :guilabel:`Timeline` on "
"the bottom. If you accidentally close or move a dock, you can quickly reset "
"all the docks back to their default location using the "
":guilabel:`View->Simple View` menu at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah tampilan **default**, dan dirancang agar mudah digunakan, "
"terutama untuk pengguna baru. Ini berisi :guilabel:`Project Files` di kiri "
"atas, :guilabel:`Preview Window` di kanan atas, dan :guilabel:`Garis Waktu` "
"di bagian bawah. Jika Anda tidak sengaja menutup atau memindahkan dock, Anda"
" dapat dengan cepat mengatur ulang semua dock ke lokasi default menggunakan "
"menu :guilabel:`View->Simple View` di bagian atas layar."

#: ../main_window.rst:330
msgid ""
"This view is focused on color correction and scopes. It enlarges the video "
"preview, hides file-management docks, keeps the timeline and properties "
"visible, places the :guilabel:`Color Wheels` dock on the right, and tabifies"
" the :guilabel:`Luma Waveform` and :guilabel:`Histogram` docks together "
"below it."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan ini berfokus pada koreksi warna dan scope. Ini memperbesar "
"pratinjau video, menyembunyikan dock manajemen file, menjaga timeline dan "
"properti tetap terlihat, menempatkan dock :guilabel:`Color Wheels` di kanan,"
" dan menggabungkan dock :guilabel:`Luma Waveform` dan :guilabel:`Histogram` "
"menjadi tab di bawahnya."

#: ../main_window.rst:335
msgid "Recording View"
msgstr "Tampilan Perekaman"

# Main-window terminology review, 2026-09-26.
#: ../main_window.rst:336
msgid ""
"This view is focused on creating new recordings inside OpenShot. It shows "
":guilabel:`Project Files`, :guilabel:`Video Preview`, :guilabel:`Timeline`, "
"and the :guilabel:`Recording` dock. The :guilabel:`Properties` dock is "
"grouped with :guilabel:`Project Files` as a tab, so you can show it from "
":guilabel:`View->Docks->Properties` without disrupting the recording layout."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan ini berfokus pada pembuatan rekaman baru di dalam OpenShot. Ini "
"menampilkan :guilabel:`Project Files`, :guilabel:`Pratinjau Video`, "
":guilabel:`Garis Waktu`, dan dock :guilabel:`Perekaman`. Dock "
":guilabel:`Properties` digabungkan dengan :guilabel:`Project Files` sebagai "
"tab, sehingga Anda dapat menampilkannya dari "
":guilabel:`View->Docks->Properties` tanpa mengganggu tata letak perekaman."

# Main-window terminology review, 2026-09-26.
#: ../main_window.rst:341
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recording` dock can record microphone audio, screen capture, "
"webcam video, or combinations of those sources. When screen and webcam are "
"recorded together, OpenShot can place the webcam as a corner picture-in-"
"picture clip. Those corner camera clips use normal clip properties after "
"they are added to the timeline: :guilabel:`Gravity` chooses the corner, "
":guilabel:`Scale X` and :guilabel:`Scale Y` set the corner size, "
":guilabel:`Margin` creates the inset layout area that keeps the camera away "
"from the screen edge, and :guilabel:`Corner Radius` rounds the camera clip "
"without adding a separate Mask effect. See :ref:`clip_properties_ref` for "
"details. See :ref:`recording_ref` for the complete recording workflow and "
"all source options."
msgstr ""
"Dock :guilabel:`Perekaman` dapat merekam audio mikrofon, tangkapan layar, "
"video webcam, atau kombinasi dari sumber-sumber tersebut. Ketika layar dan "
"webcam direkam bersama, OpenShot dapat menempatkan webcam sebagai klip "
"picture-in-picture di sudut. Klip kamera sudut tersebut menggunakan properti"
" klip normal setelah ditambahkan ke timeline: :guilabel:`Gravity` memilih "
"sudut, :guilabel:`Scale X` dan :guilabel:`Scale Y` mengatur ukuran sudut, "
":guilabel:`Margin` membuat area tata letak inset yang menjaga kamera dari "
"tepi layar, dan :guilabel:`Corner Radius` membulatkan klip kamera tanpa "
"menambahkan efek Mask terpisah. Lihat :ref:`clip_properties_ref` untuk "
"detail. Lihat :ref:`recording_ref` untuk alur kerja perekaman lengkap dan "
"semua opsi sumber."

#: ../main_window.rst:352
msgid "My Views"
msgstr "My Views"

#: ../main_window.rst:353
msgid ""
"**My Views** lets you save any dock arrangement as a named layout and recall"
" it instantly. This is ideal for workflows that require switching between "
"different editing modes — for example, a detailed audio mix layout and a "
"focused color grading layout — without manually repositioning docks each "
"time."
msgstr ""
"**My Views** memungkinkan Anda menyimpan pengaturan dock apa pun sebagai "
"tata letak bernama dan memanggilnya secara instan. Ini ideal untuk alur "
"kerja yang memerlukan pergantian antara mode pengeditan yang berbeda — "
"misalnya, tata letak campuran audio yang rinci dan tata letak grading warna "
"yang fokus — tanpa harus memposisikan ulang dock secara manual setiap kali."

#: ../main_window.rst:357
msgid ""
"Each saved view captures the position, size, and visibility of every dock, "
"as well as the timeline height. Saved views are stored in your project "
"settings and persist across sessions."
msgstr ""
"Setiap tampilan yang disimpan menangkap posisi, ukuran, dan visibilitas "
"setiap dock, serta tinggi timeline. Tampilan yang disimpan disimpan dalam "
"pengaturan proyek Anda dan bertahan antar sesi."

